[2026-03-08T16:52:55.655Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   ## Summary
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   Aether’s main strength is its low-permission MV3 architecture with strong visual theming
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   and local-only behavior. Its main reliability risk is that too much DOM detection, styling
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   policy, and feature behavior is concentrated in a few large files, especially the injected
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   content layer. The next iteration should optimize for resilience to ChatGPT UI churn
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   first, while creating cleaner seams for UI polish and release hardening afterward.
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.198Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   ## Key Changes
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.637Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.637Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:56.637Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   - Introduce a semantic surface system for injected UI.
[2026-03-08T16:52:57.255Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:57.255Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]       - Add a small overlay classifier in content.js that tags dynamic nodes with stable
[2026-03-08T16:52:57.255Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]         Aether-owned attributes such as data-aether-surface and data-aether-glass.
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.063Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.063Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]       - Limit supported surface categories to a fixed first set: tooltip, menu, dialog,
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.063Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]         toast, search-panel, source-chip, activity-flyout.
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.909Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.909Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]       - Use stable heuristics only: ARIA roles, data-testid, and a short curated list of
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.909Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]         known container anchors. Do not key behavior off transient Tailwind class chains
[2026-03-08T16:52:58.909Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]         unless no stable anchor exists.
[2026-03-08T16:52:59.525Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:59.525Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]       - Make the observer one-way and fail-fast: if a surface cannot be classified, leave it
[2026-03-08T16:52:59.525Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]         untouched rather than applying speculative fallback styling.
[2026-03-08T16:52:59.755Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node] 
[2026-03-08T16:52:59.755Z] [out] [id=2] [terminal=node]   - Refactor the injected UI layer into smaller responsibilities without changing behavior.
